/**
 * requestFacets.heldout3.spec.ts — third held-out facet set (eval-0927 P0-2).
 * 80 items (40 EN + 40 JA; 52 positives, 28 hard negatives) generated by
 * EVO-X2 in a fresh context (2026-09-27) over fifteen domains neither earlier
 * set used (migrations/ORM, CI runners, language servers, robotics, map
 * tiles, spreadsheets, transcoding, home automation, chess, weather
 * ingestion, libraries, appointment scheduling, e-learning, container
 * orchestration, static sites). Labels adjudicated by the orchestrator
 * BEFORE any scoring: "when X happens, trace what happens next" sets a scene
 * (gold flow, condition tolerated); "how many ... before eviction starts" is
 * a value question (condition tolerated).
 *
 * Scored BLIND twice: the FIX-C1 extractor (recall value 0.69 / condition
 * 0.50 / callers 0.43 / flow 0.31, 4/28 negatives with a facet) and the first
 * generalization (0.81 / 0.69 / 0.79 / 0.50, 3/28); then used as a
 * DEVELOPMENT set for the second generalization, with a fourth unseen set as
 * the blind check. This file only SCORES; it must never gain an
 * item-specific branch.
 */
